      "widgets_values": [
        "Remesh twice (solid, fill 20, 1024)\nAeroX's fix: cleans the coarse mesh before Hi3D. Without it, broken thin parts (ears) and TRELLIS.2 stair-steps carry into the detailed mesh. Also closes the coarse mesh."
      ],
